target                    owned  write  webhook
-----------------------------------------------
PROJ (project)            yes    yes    ok  stray repo hooks: PROJ/x
PROJ/my-repo              yes    no     missing
OTHER (project)           no     -      not owned by this team in teams.yaml; ask the noergler admin
LONGPROJECTKEY (project)  yes    yes    stale: url: None -> 'https://n.test/webhook/p'; active: False -> True  stray repo hooks: A/b, A/c  foreign hooks: A/d -> https://old.test/webhook
